@mandrillKey = "md-AqbvmlgwdHpbamB91M_zoQ"
@from = "no-reply@transactional-dev.physiocouncil.com.au"

### Ping (validates the API key itself)
POST https://mandrillapp.com/api/1.0/users/ping2.json
Content-Type: application/json

{"key":"{{mandrillKey}}"}

### Send (demo tier accepts only recipients @ authenticated domain)
POST https://mandrillapp.com/api/1.0/messages/send.json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "key": "{{mandrillKey}}",
    "message": {
        "from_email": "{{from}}",
        "to": [{ "email": "{{from}}", "type": "to" }],
        "subject": "POC Test",
        "text": "Sending a test email using Mandrill API",
        "merge_language": "mailchimp"
    }
}

### List Mandrill templates (separate from Mailchimp marketing templates)
POST https://mandrillapp.com/api/1.0/templates/list.json
Content-Type: application/json

{"key":"{{mandrillKey}}"}
